A '''Piston''' is a {{Common}} block that can be crafted and placed on the player's {{Zone|Private Island}} or plots in {{Zone|The Garden}}.

== Obtaining ==
=== Crafting ===
{{Crafting Recipe Table
|{{Crafting Recipe Row
 |ingredients = {{RL|1 Redstone Dust|1 Iron Ingot|3 Planks|4 Cobblestone}}
 |A1 = *Planks     |B1 = *Planks       |C1 = *Planks
 |A2 = Cobblestone |B2 = Iron Ingot    |C2 = Cobblestone
 |A3 = Cobblestone |B3 = Redstone Dust |C3 = Cobblestone
 |Output = Piston
}}
}}

== Usage ==
=== Private Island ===
'''Pistons''' can be placed as a decorative block on the player's {{Zone|Private Island}} or plots in {{Zone|The Garden}}. However, they cannot be activated from [[Redstone]].

